<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">

<head>
    <title>Оформление заказа - корзина</title>
    {% include 'blocks/head.njk' %}
</head>

<body class="preload mp">
    <div class="main-wrapper-outer">
        {% include 'blocks/header.njk' %}
        <main class="main">

            {% include 'blocks/header-search.njk' %}

            <div class="block-main block-main-order">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="block-main__content">
                        <div class="heading-complex">
                            <div class="breadcrumbs">
                                <ul>
                                    <li>
                                        <a href="#" class="home">
                                            <img src="img/icons/home.svg" alt="">
                                        </a>
                                    </li>
                                    <li><span>Корзина и оформление заказа</span></li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                            <h1 class="title1">
                                Оформление заказа
                            </h1>
                        </div>
                        <div class="filter-sorting">
                            <div class="filter-sorting__button active">
                                <span data-text="Корзина">Корзина</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="filter-sorting__button">
                                <span data-text="Данные покупателя">Данные покупателя</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="filter-sorting__button">
                                <span data-text="Выбор доставки">Выбор доставки</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="filter-sorting__button">
                                <span data-text="Способ оплаты">Способ оплаты</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="filter-sorting__button">
                                <span data-text="Итоговая смета">Итоговая смета</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="block-order">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="block-order__content">
                        <div class="block-order-cart">
                            <div class="block-order-cart__top">
                                <div class="block-order-cart__item">
                                    Товар
                                </div>
                                <div class="block-order-cart__item">
                                    Кол-во
                                </div>
                                <div class="block-order-cart__item">
                                    Стоимость
                                </div>
                                <div class="block-order-cart__item">
                                    Удалить
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="block-order-cart__cards">
                                <div class="card-cart">
                                    <div class="card-cart__left">
                                        <a href="./" class="card-cart__pic1">
                                            <img loading="lazy" src="img/products/image4.webp" alt="">
                                        </a>
                                        <div class="card-cart__item">
                                            <a href="./" class="card-cart__name">
                                                Бюстгальтер без косточек бесшовный гладкий
                                            </a>
                                            <ul>
                                                <li>
                                                    <span>Цвет:</span> Пудровый
                                                </li>
                                                <li>
                                                    <span>Размер:</span> 75 В
                                                </li>
                                            </ul>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="card-cart__right">
                                        <div class="card-cart__quantity">
                                            <div data-quantity class="quantity">
                                                <button data-quantity-minus type="button"
                                                    class="quantity__button quantity__button_minus">
                                                    <span></span>
                                                </button>
                                                <div class="quantity__input">
                                                    <input data-quantity-value autocomplete="off" type="text"
                                                        name="form[]" value="1">
                                                </div>
                                                <button data-quantity-plus type="button"
                                                    class="quantity__button quantity__button_plus">
                                                    <span></span>
                                                </button>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="card-cart__prices">
                                            <div class="card-cart__new-price">
                                                2 490 ₽
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="card-cart__old-price">
                                                4 500 ₽
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="card-cart__delete">
                                            <button type="button">
                                                <img src="img/icons/close-fill.svg" alt="">
                                            </button>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="card-cart">
                                    <div class="card-cart__left">
                                        <a href="./" class="card-cart__pic1">
                                            <img loading="lazy" src="img/products/image3.webp" alt="">
                                        </a>
                                        <div class="card-cart__item">
                                            <a href="./" class="card-cart__name">
                                                Бюстгальтер без косточек бесшовный гладкий
                                            </a>
                                            <ul>
                                                <li>
                                                    <span>Цвет:</span> Пудровый
                                                </li>
                                                <li>
                                                    <span>Размер:</span> 75 В
                                                </li>
                                            </ul>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="card-cart__right">
                                        <div class="card-cart__quantity">
                                            <div data-quantity class="quantity">
                                                <button data-quantity-minus type="button"
                                                    class="quantity__button quantity__button_minus">
                                                    <span></span>
                                                </button>
                                                <div class="quantity__input">
                                                    <input data-quantity-value autocomplete="off" type="text"
                                                        name="form[]" value="1">
                                                </div>
                                                <button data-quantity-plus type="button"
                                                    class="quantity__button quantity__button_plus">
                                                    <span></span>
                                                </button>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="card-cart__prices">
                                            <div class="card-cart__new-price">
                                                6 490 ₽
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="card-cart__old-price">
                                                6 500 ₽
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="card-cart__delete">
                                            <button type="button">
                                                <img src="img/icons/close-fill.svg" alt="">
                                            </button>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="block-order__buttons">
                            <form action="#" class="form">
                                <div class="form__input">
                                    <img loading="lazy" src="img/icons/sale-circle.svg" alt="">
                                    <input autocomplete="off" type="text" name="form[]" placeholder="Введите промокод"
                                        class="input">
                                </div>
                                <a href="./" class="btn btn-border-brown">
                                    <span>Применить</span>
                                </a>
                            </form>
                            <a href="./" class="btn">
                                <span>Далее</span>
                                <svg aria-hidden="true" width="6" height="11">
                                    <use xlink:href="img/sprite.svg#arrow1"></use>
                                </svg>
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="block-help">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="block-help__content">
                        <div class="heading-complex">
                            <h2 class="title2">
                                Возникли сложности с выбором размера или оформлением заказа?
                            </h2>
                            <p>
                                Напишите нам, мы на связи ежедневно <span class="sale-text">с 10:00 до 20:00</span>
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="block-help__buttons">
                            <a href="./" class="btn">
                                <span>Написать в Telegram</span>
                            </a>
                            <a href="./" class="btn btn-border-brown">
                                <span>Написать в MAX</span>
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </main>
        {% include 'blocks/footer.njk' %}
    </div>
    {% include 'blocks/popups.njk' %}
    {% include 'blocks/scripts.njk' %}
</body>

</html>